{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Season of War (Beta) is a dynamic 2D arcade RPG/twin-stick shooter RPG with an individually developed combat system from SinorCreate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find an exciting combination of two genres, where the variability of pumping and abilities is combined with fast, reactive battles that require strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for those who are looking for dynamic gameplay and want to &quot;kill time&quot;, enjoying pleasant 2D graphics with an unusual perspective, atmospheric music and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game requires immediate strategic decisions, and the gradual discovery of abilities and battles with interesting bosses will make the passage unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment, the game is short: there is no plot, and only 5 missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Season of War is constantly improving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In 2025, the plot will be rebuilt and filmed, and in 2026, the game will be replenished with a significantly larger number of missions and will be released in full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/957810?t=1773071012","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/957810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773071012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/957810/efae2d97b2c64d064cb6c01d30a81ac73250dbe4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773071012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/957810/efae2d97b2c64d064cb6c01d30a81ac73250dbe4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773071012","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Season of War (Beta) is a dynamic 2D arcade RPG/twin-stick shooter RPG with an individually developed combat system from SinorCreate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find an exciting combination of two genres, where the variability of pumping and abilities is combined with fast, reactive battles that require strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for those who are looking for dynamic gameplay and want to &quot;kill time&quot;, enjoying pleasant 2D graphics with an unusual perspective, atmospheric music and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game requires immediate strategic decisions, and the gradual discovery of abilities and battles with interesting bosses will make the passage unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment, the game is short: there is no plot, and only 5 missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, Season of War is constantly improving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In 2025, the plot will be rebuilt and filmed, and in 2026, the game will be replenished with a significantly larger number of missions and will be released in full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SinorCreate"],"dlc":[1555810],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/957810/header.jpg?t=1773071012","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"SinorCreate all rights reserved.<br />\r\n\u00a9 (\"SinorCreate\", \"C\u0438\u043d\u043e\u0440\u041a\u0440\u0438\u0435\u0439\u0442\") \u0422\u0440\u0443\u0442\u043d\u0435\u0432 \u0410.\u0410., 2018\u20142022<br />\r\n\u00a9 (\"SinorCreate\") Trutnev A.A.,2018\u20142022","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"da